            <p className="mb-3 text-xs text-muted">Shown in every model switcher. <span className="font-mono">id</span> is passed to <span className="font-mono">claude --model</span> (alias like <span className="font-mono">opus</span> or a full model id).</p>
            <div className="flex flex-col gap-2">
